Subject: [PATCH] media: list the speakers the profile claims

enumerateDevices() lists the speakers the profile claims, the same way
it lists claimed microphones, with the default entry and, for a Windows
profile, the communications entry Windows adds. Without this, a host
with no sound card lists no audiooutput, and every real Windows and
macOS machine lists one. A page without permission sees one entry per
kind with empty ids and labels, as in stock Chrome. Sound sent to a
claimed speaker goes to Chrome's own silent output.

